  "description": "The Fuji Boulevard is a stylish, everyday e-bike designed for comfort, versatility, and confident cruising. Powered by a Bafang 250W rear hub motor and 360Wh internal battery, it delivers up to 40 miles of range with throttle-on-demand capability for extra support when hills or traffic get in your way. The lightweight aluminum frame, wide 27.5x2.4” tires, and upright geometry provide a smooth, stable ride across city streets and rough pavement. A Shimano CUES 1x9 drivetrain offers reliable shifting with minimal fuss, while integrated front and rear lights ensure visibility day or night. Available in both diamond and low-step frame styles, the Boulevard is your go-to ride for commuting, errands, and everyday adventures.",
